# Obsidian vault (.md notes) - sensible public repo ignores

## OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.tmp
.idea/
.vscode/

## Obsidian local workspace/cache (user-specific, changes constantly)
/.obsidian/workspace*
/.obsidian/cache/
/.obsidian/plugins/*/data.json

## Optional: ignore ALL Obsidian settings/plugins (uncomment if you prefer a "pure notes" repo)
# /.obsidian/

## Optional: keep attachments out of git if they are huge
# /attachments/

## Optional: if you also store Unity projects here, you may want Unity ignores too.
## (Paste Unity.gitignore below this line.)
